* cics-crucible commarea-mismatch / ca-address-twa-tctua
DEFINE PROGRAM(CATWAD) GROUP(CRUCCA9) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
DEFINE PROGRAM(CATWSB) GROUP(CRUCCA9) LANGUAGE(COBOL)
* CA0H has a 32-byte transaction work area; CA0I states TWASIZE(0)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CA0H) GROUP(CRUCCA9) PROGRAM(CATWAD) TWASIZE(32)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CA0I) GROUP(CRUCCA9) PROGRAM(CATWAD) TWASIZE(0)
DEFINE TRANSACTION(CA0J) GROUP(CRUCCA9) PROGRAM(CATWAD)
* T001: ATI/TTI as SPEC section 2 requires; USERAREALEN(16) gives every
* terminal of this TYPETERM a 16-byte terminal control table user area
DEFINE TYPETERM(CRU3278) GROUP(CRUCCA9) DEVICE(3270) TERMMODEL(2)
       ATI(YES) TTI(YES) USERAREALEN(16)
DEFINE TERMINAL(T001) GROUP(CRUCCA9) TYPETERM(CRU3278)
